{"id": "Ugz041QPU_rLztzXrg54AaABAg.AcTC4UXDQ9NAcezlUbxIOb", "parent": "Ugz041QPU_rLztzXrg54AaABAg", "likes": 0, "text": "他優勢只有配息，只要大跌，進入空方市場時，才能知道配息是不是能維持相同水平", "published": "2026-11-01T10:08:48", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
